  {"id":49,"x":10,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Labyrinth","descriptions":["Tall stalks of ripe corn tower high on either side of the thoroughfare that winds through the field, forming a thick, dense maze.  The leaves and branches bend inward and almost meet overhead, giving the maze an almost claustrophobic feel.  Dry, almost dusty dirt lies bare in neat, even spaces between the ripening rows, which have changed from a green to a nearly golden color.","Tall stalks of corn tower high on either side of the thoroughfare, forming a thick, dense maze.","The silhouettes of tall stalks of ripe corn tower high on either side of the thoroughfare that winds through the field, forming a thick, dense maze.  The leaves and branches bend inward and almost meet overhead, nearly blotting out the night sky.  Dry, almost dusty dirt lies bare in neat, even spaces between the ripening rows, which form a thick wall in the nighttime darkness.","The silhouettes of tall stalks of corn tower high on either side of the thoroughfare, forming a thick, dense maze."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":102,"exit":"go","move":"go small tunnel"}],"aliases":["Labyrinth","cheerful Halfling"]},
  {"id":50,"x":150,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Left Wing","descriptions":["Golden silk tufts decorate the tops of the ripe green corn stalks, capping each plant with a small tuft of harvest yellow.  The area is quite precisely sculpted, making the maze wide enough without wasting too much of the harvest.  Rustling leaves send a faint shimmer of sound over the maze, partnered by a gentle swaying back and forth of the tall green plants.","Golden silk tufts decorate the tops of the ripe green corn stalks.","The silhouette of tall corn stalks capped with silk wavers on either side of the thoroughfare, each one tall enough to obscure the rest of the field.  The area is quite precisely sculpted, making the maze wide enough without wasting too much of the harvest.  Rustling leaves send a faint shimmer of sound over the maze, partnered by a gentle swaying back and forth of the tall plants.","The silhouette of tall corn stalks capped with silk wavers on either side of the thoroughfare."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":39,"exit":"go","move":"go small tunnel"}],"aliases":["Dragon's Left Wing","Left Wing","carefree Halfling"]},
  {"id":51,"x":170,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Left Wing","descriptions":["Golden silk tufts decorate the tops of the ripe green corn stalks, capping each plant with a small tuft of harvest yellow.  The area is quite precisely sculpted, making the maze wide enough without wasting too much of the harvest.  Rustling leaves send a faint shimmer of sound over the maze, partnered by a gentle swaying back and forth of the tall green plants.","Golden silk tufts decorate the tops of the ripe green corn stalks.","The silhouette of tall corn stalks capped with silk wavers on either side of the thoroughfare, each one tall enough to obscure the rest of the field.  The area is quite precisely sculpted, making the maze wide enough without wasting too much of the harvest.  Rustling leaves send a faint shimmer of sound over the maze, partnered by a gentle swaying back and forth of the tall plants.","The silhouette of tall corn stalks capped with silk wavers on either side of the thoroughfare."],"exits":[{"to":52,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":97,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":50,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
