  {"id":101,"x":210,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Left Wing","descriptions":["Golden silk tufts decorate the tops of the ripe green corn stalks, capping each plant with a small tuft of harvest yellow.  The area is quite precisely sculpted, making the maze wide enough without wasting too much of the harvest.  Rustling leaves send a faint shimmer of sound over the maze, partnered by a gentle swaying back and forth of the tall green plants.","Golden silk tufts decorate the tops of the ripe green corn stalks.","The silhouette of tall corn stalks capped with silk wavers on either side of the thoroughfare, each one tall enough to obscure the rest of the field.  The area is quite precisely sculpted, making the maze wide enough without wasting too much of the harvest.  Rustling leaves send a faint shimmer of sound over the maze, partnered by a gentle swaying back and forth of the tall plants.","The silhouette of tall corn stalks capped with silk wavers on either side of the thoroughfare."],"exits":[{"to":84,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":100,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":102,"x":10,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Green Growth","descriptions":["Deep green stalks of corn rise in every direction, making it difficult to determine any clear path forward or backward.  The space between the rows is fairly wide, and some entrepreneurial grass and weeds grow in between the towering stalks of corn.  Insects buzz among the hardy plants that cover the thoroughfare.","Deep green stalks of corn rise in every direction, and some grass and weeds grow between the towering stalks of corn.","Dark stalks of corn rise in every direction, making it very difficult to determine any clear path in the darkness.  The space between the rows is fairly wide, and the ground is rather soft from the undergrowth between the towering stalks of corn.  Crickets constantly chirp, their symphony filling the nighttime air with a cacophonous chorus.","Dark stalks of corn rise in every direction, and the space between the rows is fairly wide."],"exits":[{"to":103,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":49,"exit":"go","move":"go small tunnel"}],"aliases":["Green Growth","blight locusts","locusts"]},
  {"id":103,"x":10,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Green Growth","descriptions":["Deep green stalks of corn rise in every direction, making it difficult to determine any clear path forward or backward.  The space between the rows is fairly wide, and some entrepreneurial grass and weeds grow in between the towering stalks of corn.  Insects buzz among the hardy plants that cover the thoroughfare.","Deep green stalks of corn rise in every direction, and some grass and weeds grow between the towering stalks of corn.","Dark stalks of corn rise in every direction, making it very difficult to determine any clear path in the darkness.  The space between the rows is fairly wide, and the ground is rather soft from the undergrowth between the towering stalks of corn.  Crickets constantly chirp, their symphony filling the nighttime air with a cacophonous chorus.","Dark stalks of corn rise in every direction, and the space between the rows is fairly wide."],"exits":[{"to":102,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":104,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["life-sized Halfling statue"]},
