  {"id":150,"x":50,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Neck","descriptions":["Corn stalks grow tall, the tracks between them dry furrows in the ground and mostly clear of undergrowth.  Fallen leaves from the harvest blanket the ground sporadically, making it rather soft and almost organic.  Jumping grasshoppers hop from place to place, their color matching the tall stalks very closely.","Corn stalks grow tall, the tracks between them dry furrows in the ground.","The silhouettes of corn stalks grow tall, blotting out most of the nighttime light and leaving barely enough to see by.  Fallen leaves from the harvest blanket the ground sporadically, making walking almost silent and hushing the area.  The insects are mostly silent in this section of the maze, giving it an eerie atmosphere.","The silhouettes of corn stalks grow tall, blotting out most of the nighttime light."],"exits":[{"to":151,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":154,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":104,"exit":"go","move":"go small tunnel"}],"aliases":["Dragon's Neck","Neck","tired Halfling"]},
