  {"id":185,"x":110,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Neck","descriptions":["Corn stalks grow tall, the tracks between them dry furrows in the ground and mostly clear of undergrowth.  Fallen leaves from the harvest blanket the ground sporadically, making it rather soft and almost organic.  Jumping grasshoppers hop from place to place, their color matching the tall stalks very closely.","Corn stalks grow tall, the tracks between them dry furrows in the ground.","The silhouettes of corn stalks grow tall, blotting out most of the nighttime light and leaving barely enough to see by.  Fallen leaves from the harvest blanket the ground sporadically, making walking almost silent and hushing the area.  The insects are mostly silent in this section of the maze, giving it an eerie atmosphere.","The silhouettes of corn stalks grow tall, blotting out most of the nighttime light."],"exits":[{"to":184,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":186,"exit":"go","move":"go small tunnel"}]},
  {"id":186,"x":130,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Belly","descriptions":["Dense walls of corn stalks line the narrow path, growing tall and relatively undisturbed.  The Gor'Tog high green plants stretch in every direction, forming neatly planted rows.  The monotony of the harvest makes the maze quite confusing as the surrounding environment is obscured and all looks the same.","Dense walls of corn stalks line the narrow path, the monotony making the maze quite confusing.","Dark walls of corn stalks line narrow path, growing tall and relatively undisturbed.  The walls are relatively narrow in the area, bringing an almost claustrophobic feel to the corn maze.  Walls of corn lie close in nearly every direction, and the twisting paths make the environment all look the same in the oppressive darkness.","Dark walls of corn stalks line narrow path, the maze tight and almost claustrophobic."],"exits":[{"to":187,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":185,"exit":"go","move":"go small tunnel"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Dragon's Belly","Belly","tall Gor'Tog","large boulder"]},
