  {"id":225,"x":170,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Legs","descriptions":["Dense walls of corn stalks line the narrow path, growing tall and relatively undisturbed.  The Gor'Tog high green plants stretch in every direction, forming neatly planted rows.  The monotony of the harvest makes the maze quite confusing as the surrounding environment is obscured and all looks the same.","Dense walls of corn stalks line the narrow path, the monotony making the maze quite confusing.","Dark walls of corn stalks line narrow path, growing tall and relatively undisturbed.  The walls are relatively narrow in the area, bringing an almost claustrophobic feel to the corn maze.  Walls of corn lie close in nearly every direction, and the twisting paths make the environment all look the same in the oppressive darkness.","Dark walls of corn stalks line narrow path, the maze tight and almost claustrophobic."],"exits":[{"to":221,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":226,"x":90,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Neck","descriptions":["The silhouettes of corn stalks grow tall, blotting out most of the nighttime light and leaving barely enough to see by.  Fallen leaves from the harvest blanket the ground sporadically, making walking almost silent and hushing the area.  The insects are mostly silent in this section of the maze, giving it an eerie atmosphere."],"exits":[{"to":153,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":100,"exit":"go","move":"go small tunnel"}],"aliases":["Dragon's Neck","Neck","tired Halfling"]},
  {"id":227,"x":350,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Right Wing","descriptions":["The stalks appear ripe and close to ready for harvest, and tower up quite high to make walls of greenery on either side of the thoroughfare.  Thin green stalks from already harvested plants line the bottom of the path, trampled down in a sort of carpet that has seen quite a bit of traffic.  Insects buzz about lazily in through the leaves, and the occasional grasshopper jumps about near the roots of the plants.","The stalks appear ripe and close to ready for harvest.","The stalks appear ripe and close to ready for harvest, and tower up quite high to make dark, thick walls of on either side of the thoroughfare.  Prickly stalks from already harvested plants line the bottom of the path, trampled down in a sort of carpet that has seen quite a bit of traffic.  Crickets chirp enthusiastically through the leaves, making quite a racket in the darkness.","The stalks appear ripe and close to ready for harvest."],"exits":[{"to":279,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":228,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":72,"exit":"go","move":"go small tunnel"}],"aliases":["Dragon's Right Wing","Right Wing","playful Halfling"]},
