  {"id":286,"x":370,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Right Wing","descriptions":["The stalks appear ripe and close to ready for harvest, and tower up quite high to make walls of greenery on either side of the thoroughfare.  Thin green stalks from already harvested plants line the bottom of the path, trampled down in a sort of carpet that has seen quite a bit of traffic.  Insects buzz about lazily in through the leaves, and the occasional grasshopper jumps about near the roots of the plants.","The stalks appear ripe and close to ready for harvest.","The stalks appear ripe and close to ready for harvest, and tower up quite high to make dark, thick walls of on either side of the thoroughfare.  Prickly stalks from already harvested plants line the bottom of the path, trampled down in a sort of carpet that has seen quite a bit of traffic.  Crickets chirp enthusiastically through the leaves, making quite a racket in the darkness.","The stalks appear ripe and close to ready for harvest."],"exits":[{"to":232,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":236,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":231,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":287,"x":450,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Back","descriptions":["The tops of the corn stalks in this area bend toward each other, creating more of a tunnel through the maze than a clear path.  Loose corn silks are strewn over the plants, and bare patches show where a few ears have already been plucked.  Thickly clustered plants almost ready to harvest grow tall enough to obscure the view, making it difficult to get any bearings.","The tops of the corn stalks in this area bend toward each other, and bare patches show where a few ears have been plucked.","The tops of the corn plants in this area bend toward each other, blocking out almost all of the already dim nighttime light.  A few glowbugs dance among the crop, drawn to a few puddles of water between the heavy plants.  Few and far between, the clouds of insects provide just enough light to keep travelers from blundering into the thick walls.","A few glowbugs dance among the corn stalks, providing a wan light."],"exits":[{"to":288,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":289,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":239,"exit":"go","move":"go small tunnel"}],"aliases":["Dragon's Back","Back"]},
  {"id":288,"x":490,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Back","descriptions":["The tops of the corn stalks in this area bend toward each other, creating more of a tunnel through the maze than a clear path.  Loose corn silks are strewn over the plants, and bare patches show where a few ears have already been plucked.  Thickly clustered plants almost ready to harvest grow tall enough to obscure the view, making it difficult to get any bearings.","The tops of the corn stalks in this area bend toward each other, and bare patches show where a few ears have been plucked.","The tops of the corn plants in this area bend toward each other, blocking out almost all of the already dim nighttime light.  A few glowbugs dance among the crop, drawn to a few puddles of water between the heavy plants.  Few and far between, the clouds of insects provide just enough light to keep travelers from blundering into the thick walls.","A few glowbugs dance among the corn stalks, providing a wan light."],"exits":[{"to":289,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":287,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":289,"x":490,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Back","descriptions":["The tops of the corn stalks in this area bend toward each other, creating more of a tunnel through the maze than a clear path.  Loose corn silks are strewn over the plants, and bare patches show where a few ears have already been plucked.  Thickly clustered plants almost ready to harvest grow tall enough to obscure the view, making it difficult to get any bearings.","The tops of the corn stalks in this area bend toward each other, and bare patches show where a few ears have been plucked.","The tops of the corn plants in this area bend toward each other, blocking out almost all of the already dim nighttime light.  A few glowbugs dance among the crop, drawn to a few puddles of water between the heavy plants.  Few and far between, the clouds of insects provide just enough light to keep travelers from blundering into the thick walls.","A few glowbugs dance among the corn stalks, providing a wan light."],"exits":[{"to":288,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":351,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":352,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":287,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["small boulder"]},
  {"id":290,"x":610,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Ripened Field","descriptions":["Standing at least eight feet tall, the huge stalks of corn appear fully ripe and sport numerous ears.  Several stalks have the leaves peeled back slightly and the bright yellow seeds showing, likely right on the cusp of needing to be harvested.  The growth looks quite healthy, making the walls of corn appear next to impossible to push through or see past.","Standing at least eight feet tall, the huge stalks of corn appear fully ripe.","Dark corn stalks rise high on either side of the thoroughfare, at least eight feet tall and fully ripe.  The growth blocks out most of the night sky, only a sliver of it visible overhead.  The harvest in this area appears very dense, creating nearly solid walls that twist and turn in the darkness.","Dark corn stalks rise high on either side of the thoroughfare, at least eight feet tall and fully ripe."],"exits":[{"to":292,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":346,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":320,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":246,"exit":"go","move":"go small tunnel"}],"aliases":["Ripened Field","Field","murder crows","crows"]},
