  {"id":425,"x":670,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Blight","descriptions":["The corn in this section of the cornfield seems sad and withered, with both the leaves and the stalks almost fully yellowed with only occasional streaks of green within them.  A large portion of the crop is partially bent over, tangled up with each other and unfit for both harvesting and consumption.  A large swath of corn is cut out of the field in a jagged line, likely to separate the diseased corner of the field from the otherwise healthy harvest.","The corn in this section of the cornfield seems sad and withered, and a large swath of corn is cut out of the field in a jagged line.","Stunted and blighted stalks of corn stand withered in the darkness, tangled up with each other in a maze of ruined and diseased crops.  A putrid smell comes from several of the struggling plants, and the vague outline of insects crawl on the ruined leaves, making them look eerily undead in the dim light.  Though the stalks are much shorter than other places in the field, the diseased and tangled nature of the walls makes crossing them impractical.","Stunted and blighted stalks of corn stand withered in the darkness, insects on them making them seem eerily undead."],"exits":[{"to":412,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":442,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":424,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["pile of smooth stones"]},
  {"id":426,"x":710,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Sleeping Dragon Corn Maze, Exit","descriptions":["Set up as a small celebration area, the area just outside the exit to the corn maze is surrounded by a wooden fence and filled with hay bales, tables, and brightly colored decorations.  Any grass in the area is thoroughly trampled by the heavy foot traffic, and the smell of ale hangs heavily in the air.  Farmers in stained work clothes stand at tables hawking their wares, accompanied by some better dressed men and women who are likely the maze's sponsors."],"exits":[{"to":430,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Corn Maze Exit","Exit","shop01","harried Halfling"]},
  {"id":427,"x":210,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Eye Pond","descriptions":["Large stones frame the little pond, which is surrounded on all sides by the wafting corn.  The still water is rather clean and a couple feet deep, and several insects skate along its surface.  A small steel pipe is visible at one end of the pool, which appears to be the source of the body of water.","A small steel pipe is visible at one end of the pool, which appears to be the source of the body of water."],"exits":[{"to":174,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow bank"}],"color":"#0000FF","aliases":["Dragon's Eye Pond","Eye Pond","Pond"]},
  {"id":428,"x":670,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Tail","descriptions":["The tops of the corn stalks in this area bend toward each other, creating more of a tunnel through the maze than a clear path.  Loose corn silks are strewn over the plants, and bare patches show where a few ears have already been plucked.  Thickly clustered plants almost ready to harvest grow tall enough to obscure the view, making it difficult to get any bearings.","The tops of the corn stalks in this area bend toward each other, and bare patches show where a few ears have been plucked.","The tops of the corn plants in this area bend toward each other, blocking out almost all of the already dim nighttime light.  A few glowbugs dance among the crop, drawn to a few puddles of water between the heavy plants.  Few and far between, the clouds of insects provide just enough light to keep travelers from blundering into the thick walls.","A few glowbugs dance among the corn stalks, providing a wan light."],"exits":[]},
  {"id":429,"x":670,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Dragon's Tail","descriptions":["The tops of the corn stalks in this area bend toward each other, creating more of a tunnel through the maze than a clear path.  Loose corn silks are strewn over the plants, and bare patches show where a few ears have already been plucked.  Thickly clustered plants almost ready to harvest grow tall enough to obscure the view, making it difficult to get any bearings.","The tops of the corn stalks in this area bend toward each other, and bare patches show where a few ears have been plucked.","The tops of the corn plants in this area bend toward each other, blocking out almost all of the already dim nighttime light.  A few glowbugs dance among the crop, drawn to a few puddles of water between the heavy plants.  Few and far between, the clouds of insects provide just enough light to keep travelers from blundering into the thick walls.","A few glowbugs dance among the corn stalks, providing a wan light."],"exits":[]},
  {"id":430,"x":710,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Sleeping Dragon Corn Maze, Small Clearing","descriptions":["Set up as a small celebration area, the festival area for the corn maze is surrounded by a wooden fence.  Any grass in the area is thoroughly trampled by the heavy foot traffic, and the smell of ale hangs heavily in the air."],"exits":[{"to":426,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":434,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":435,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":431,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":439,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":438,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":"go circuitous path","hidden":true}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["shop03","tired Halfling","circuitous path that goes around to the start of the maze","path that goes around to the start of the maze","single task tickets","tickets"]},
  {"id":431,"x":710,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Sleeping Dragon Corn Maze, Rest Area","descriptions":["Set up as a small celebration area, the festival area for the corn maze is surrounded by a wooden fence.  Any grass in the area is thoroughly trampled by the heavy foot traffic, and the smell of ale hangs heavily in the air."],"exits":[{"to":430,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":435,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":432,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":439,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["shop06","repair kit","almanac","spectral reaper","reaper","tyrium hand","farmer's journal","glass egg","shimmering outfit","gwererest shell","chakrel","jewelry outfit","armor outfit","outfits","Gnomish gadget","embiggening device","instruments","thug powder"]},
  {"id":432,"x":710,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Sleeping Dragon Corn Maze, Rest Area","descriptions":["Set up as a small celebration area, the festival area for the corn maze is surrounded by a wooden fence.  Any grass in the area is thoroughly trampled by the heavy foot traffic, and the smell of ale hangs heavily in the air."],"exits":[{"to":431,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":436,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":433,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":440,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["shop09","feature compact","compact","cornhusk token","alteration token","feature mirrors"]},
  {"id":433,"x":710,"y":760,"z":0,"title":"Sleeping Dragon Corn Maze, Rest Clearing","descriptions":["Set up as a small celebration area, the festival area for the corn maze is surrounded by a wooden fence.  Any grass in the area is thoroughly trampled by the heavy foot traffic, and the smell of ale hangs heavily in the air."],"exits":[{"to":432,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["shop11","shifty Halfling","Incidental Exchange","Exchange"]},
