  {"id":435,"x":730,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Sleeping Dragon Corn Maze, Rest Area","descriptions":["Set up as a small celebration area, the festival area for the corn maze is surrounded by a wooden fence.  Any grass in the area is thoroughly trampled by the heavy foot traffic, and the smell of ale hangs heavily in the air."],"exits":[{"to":434,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":436,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":431,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":430,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["shop07","abyss","containers","river otter","otter","weapon harness","multi-strapped carryall","carryall","locksmith's training box","siegery piece"]},
  {"id":436,"x":730,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Sleeping Dragon Corn Maze, Rest Area","descriptions":["Set up as a small celebration area, the festival area for the corn maze is surrounded by a wooden fence.  Any grass in the area is thoroughly trampled by the heavy foot traffic, and the smell of ale hangs heavily in the air."],"exits":[{"to":435,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":432,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["shop10","sraeth earcuff","universal translator","inkpots","runic tattoos","spell wands","magic wands","magical devices","targeted foci","TM foci","ritual foci","ornate stat rings","stat rings","gaethzen"]},
  {"id":438,"x":690,"y":700,"z":0,"title":"Sleeping Dragon Corn Maze, Rest Area","descriptions":["Set up as a small celebration area, the festival area for the corn maze is surrounded by a wooden fence.  Any grass in the area is thoroughly trampled by the heavy foot traffic, and the smell of ale hangs heavily in the air."],"exits":[{"to":430,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":439,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["shop02","agonite mail","agonite armor","armor","shields"]},
  {"id":439,"x":690,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Sleeping Dragon Corn Maze, Rest Area","descriptions":["Set up as a small celebration area, the festival area for the corn maze is surrounded by a wooden fence.  Any grass in the area is thoroughly trampled by the heavy foot traffic, and the smell of ale hangs heavily in the air."],"exits":[{"to":438,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":430,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":431,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":440,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["shop05","T'Kashi mirror flail","greatsword","weapons","ammunition","ammo","athames","boozeblade","cambrinth staff","glitter weapons","throwing spider","jumping spider","blowgun","blowgun darts","throwing stars"]},
  {"id":440,"x":690,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Sleeping Dragon Corn Maze, Rest Area","descriptions":["Set up as a small celebration area, the festival area for the corn maze is surrounded by a wooden fence.  Any grass in the area is thoroughly trampled by the heavy foot traffic, and the smell of ale hangs heavily in the air."],"exits":[{"to":439,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":432,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["shop08","Wayerd pyramid","engineering tools","crafting tools","crafting materials","crafting grab bags","grab bags"]},
  {"id":441,"x":-10,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Hilltop, Road","descriptions":["A peaceful valley, sheltered by the surrounding hills, is laid out before you like a patchwork quilt of flowery meadows and neatly arranged farmland.  Centered in this multicolored vista is a small village.  You pause on the hilltop to enjoy this delightful view.  A meadowlark circles overhead for a moment, warbling its song to you, before swooping down toward the village, following the line of a well-traveled road.","The moonlight reveals a small valley stretched out between the surrounding hills.  You can see a multitude of tiny lamplights twinkling in the darkness below, and faroff sounds of laughter and singing hover in the sweet evening air.  The faint outline of a road descends down into the night-cloaked valley."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":"go meandering path"}],"aliases":["NTR","Crossing"],"linksTo":"Map7_NTR.xml"},
  {"id":442,"x":690,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Corn Maze, Exit","descriptions":["The corn in this section of the cornfield seems sad and withered, with both the leaves and the stalks almost fully yellowed with only occasional streaks of green within them.  A large portion of the crop is partially bent over, tangled up with each other and unfit for both harvesting and consumption.  A large swath of corn is cut out of the field in a jagged line, likely to separate the diseased corner of the field from the otherwise healthy harvest."],"exits":[{"to":425,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":426,"exit":"go","move":"go exit"}]}
 ],
